    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Berserker 4, renewed vigor rage power</p><p>While raging, the berserker ignores the effect of 1 point of ability penalty or damage per two berserker levels she has (maximum 10). Once per day, when a berserker with ability penalties or damage ends her rage, she can reroll a saving throw, if any, against an effect that imposed an ability penalty or dealt her ability damage. If successful, she removes an amount of ability penalty or damage equal to the amount she can ignore while raging.</p>",
